<!-- SAAS -->
<div class="page active" id="page-saas">
  <div class="pt"><div class="chip">🛠 SaaS Tools</div><h1>Tools that work<br><em>while you don't.</em></h1><p>Real automation tools built by a real business owner. No fluff. No filler. Built to solve actual problems, tested in an actual store.</p></div>
  <div class="pb">
    <div class="sl">Ready to use</div>
    <div class="grid">
      <div class="pc"><div class="pca" style="background:#6b3fa0"></div><div class="pci">🗺️</div><span class="pct t-pu">⭐ Most Popular</span><h3>Competitor Intel Engine</h3><p class="pcd">See who's outranking you on Google Maps, their review strength, and exactly where you can beat them — in 60 seconds.</p><div class="pcf"><div class="pcp">$29<small>/mo · 3-day free trial</small></div><a href="https://competitor-intel-engine.replit.app" target="_blank" class="btn btn-p">Start Free Trial →</a></div></div>
      <div class="pc"><div class="pca" style="background:#a06b1a"></div><div class="pci">🧾</div><span class="pct t-am">Mobile App</span><h3>ReceiptVault</h3><p class="pcd">Snap a photo of any receipt. It automatically organizes it and emails it to your accountant. No more panic at tax time.</p><div class="pcf"><div class="pcp">Free<small>Then $9.99/mo</small></div><a href="https://receipts.dealdily.com" target="_blank" class="btn btn-g">Try Free →</a></div></div>
      <div class="pc"><div class="pca" style="background:#1a7a4a"></div><div class="pci">📲</div><span class="pct t-gn">Automation</span><h3>SMS Reminder Bot</h3><p class="pcd">Text it like a human. "Remind me to call the doctor Friday at 3pm" — done. No app. No setup. Just smart reminders.</p><div class="pcf"><div class="pcp">$9<small>/mo · Plans available</small></div><button onclick="goPage('sms')" class="btn btn-p">Get Started →</button></div></div>
      <div class="pc"><div class="pca" style="background:#1a5caa"></div><div class="pci">🤖</div><span class="pct t-bl">API</span><h3>AI Content Repurposer</h3><p class="pcd">Paste a YouTube link. Get captions for TikTok, Instagram, LinkedIn, Twitter, Facebook & Pinterest. One API call.</p><div class="pcf"><div class="pcp">$27<small>/mo · API access</small></div><a href="https://toolsmith721.gumroad.com/l/ai-content-repurposer" target="_blank" class="btn btn-p">Get API →</a></div></div>
